#: taxocommerce-connections.php
msgid "TaxoCommerce Connections (Compatibility Bridge)"
msgstr "TaxoCommerce Connections (passerelle de compatibilité)"

#. Description of the plugin
#: taxocommerce-connections.php
msgid ""
"Temporary compatibility bridge. External connections now live inside "
"TaxoCommerce Insights."
msgstr "Passerelle de compatibilité temporaire. Les connexions externes se trouvent désormais dans TaxoCommerce Insights."

#. Author of the plugin
